# README media: LIMPET. Everything in play is the demo player's real button
# presses. The GIF is Rampway, the second deck: rolling up walls, round the
# ends of ledges, warping across, the bulb and the pod.
shotscale 2
seed 20
game limpet
wait 60
shot limpet_title
press A
wait 40
press A
botuntil state == 2 600
botplay 30
shot limpet_hub
cheat level 1
gifstart limpet 3 1
botplay 660
gifstop
# Pantry: outline blocks shot solid to bridge a spike pit
cheat botplan 1
cheat level 6
botplay 520
shot limpet_pantry
# the Ribcage's bones and crawlers
cheat level 13
botplay 330
shot limpet_ribcage
# the Turncoat
cheat level 27
botplay 150
shot limpet_turncoat
# the Dreadnought, its core open
cheat level 28
botplay 300
shot limpet_dread
# the station opening up: the crane lifting its crate, seen in a scene
cheat setcleared 3
cheat level 6
cheat finish
waituntil state == 9 300
wait 80
shot limpet_scene
# the canteen, with Rolo's loop line and the bridge of honey
cheat setcleared 9
cheat sethoney 24
cheat level 29
cheat pos 140 66 0
wait 30
shot limpet_canteen
